sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User / Application
  participant E as External API Spec Source
  participant O as Orion Link
  participant R as Client Library / Pool / Sidecar

  U->>E: Request external OpenAPI specification
  E-->>U: Return API spec (YAML / JSON)
  U->>O: Submit spec + configurations
  Note over O: Parse spec and generate strongly typed client
  Note over O: Configure validation, logging, and dashboards
  Note over O: Publish library with versioning
  O->>R: Deploy to heterogeneous pool, common pool, or sidecar
  U->>R: Invoke API request
  R->>O: Apply extensions (auth, caching, etc.)
  O->>E: Forward API call
  E-->>O: Return API response
  O->>O: Validate response and log
  O-->>U: Return response
  O-->>R: Push server-injected updates (if any)
